{"title": "SG Mad", "pageid": 34978, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/SG_Mad", "categories": ["Status groups"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><b>SG_Mad</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_group\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status group\">status group</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_in_SG_Mad\">List of conditions in SG_Mad</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Berserk\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Berserk_(Condition)\" title=\"Berserk (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Berserk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Berserk_(Condition)\" title=\"Berserk (Condition)\">Berserk</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>A frenetic rage racks the affected entity's flesh. Its <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Flesh)\" title=\"Multiattack (Flesh)\">Multiattacks</a> each deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage and knocks targets <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a></li>\n<li>It also gains <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to Slashing, Piercing, and Bludgeoning damage, and has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on Strength <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li>\n<li>This frenzy ends if the affected entity regains all its hit points.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Crown_of_Madness\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Crown of Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crown of Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Crown of Madness (Condition)\">Crown of Madness</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Instilled with magical madness. Will attack the nearest creature, other than the spellcaster.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Demonspirit_Madness\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Demonspirit Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">Demonspirit Madness</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity has been driven to a frenzy by magical madness. It will attack the nearest creature on its turn.</li>\n<li>At the end of each turn, the affected entity makes a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. On a successful save, the condition is removed.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Insanity's_Kiss\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Insanity%27s_Kiss_(Condition)\" title=\"Insanity's Kiss (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Insanity's Kiss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Insanity%27s_Kiss_(Condition)\" title=\"Insanity's Kiss (Condition)\">Insanity's Kiss</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Hostile</a> to all other creatures for the condition's duration.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Madness\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Madness (Condition)\">Madness</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Hostile</a> to everyone in the vicinity.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Shadow_Possession\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Possession (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Possession\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Possession (Condition)\">Shadow Possession</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is possessed by frenzied shadows and will attack the nearest creature. Its weapon attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211529\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1614/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25448/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5240/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 641070/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.047      1 Template:Status_group_page\n100.00%   35.047      1 -total\n 49.03%   17.184      6 Template:Conditions_table/row\n 46.02%   16.128      6 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 44.32%   15.533      6 Template:Icon_link\n 42.53%   14.907      6 Template:Icon_text\n 37.24%   13.053     13 Template:Trim\n 23.31%    8.168      6 Template:Ifempty\n 13.59%    4.762      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  9.74%    3.412      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34978-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211529 and revision id 216146. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}